  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      188.69,
      536.91,
      267.98
    ],
    "text": "The Very Severe Cyclonic Storm \u201cArnab\u201d over West-central Bay of Bengal lay centered at 11.30 a.m. of today, the 27 October 2026, near Latitude 16.2\u00b0N and Longitude 83.7\u00b0E about 800 km to the north-east of Kankasanthurai. Thereafter, it is very likely to cross the Indian land through Andhra Pradesh as a very severe cyclonic storm around 11.30 a.m. on the 28th.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027,
      12.0,
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      278.24,
      537.79,
      314.33
    ],
    "text": "It is expected that the impact of this system on the weather conditions across the island will gradually decrease starting tomorrow.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.9600000381469727,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      327.32,
      535.61,
      362.69
    ],
    "text": "Several spells of showers will occur in Western, Sabaragamuwa provinces and in Kandy, Nuwara-Eliya, Galle and Matara districts.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.9600000381469727,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      365.48,
      538.06,
      404.81
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thunder showers will occur at few places in Uva province and in Batticaloa and Ampara districts after 1.00 p.m.",
    "fonts": [
